# NOTICE

`dsh-code-insight` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin built on top of **Code Insight**,
the C/C++ symbol indexer shipped as the `code-insight` VS Code extension.

The directory `lib/vendor/src/core/**` and `lib/vendor/src/shared/**` in this
package is a **compiled copy** of the upstream extension's `src/core` and
`src/shared` TypeScript modules (compiled to CommonJS by
`scripts/build-core.mjs`; the upstream modules themselves are unmodified).
The exact upstream version and commit are recorded in
`lib/vendor/UPSTREAM.json`.

